WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
♪

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.628
[Lee] Let's fly, baby!

00:00:02.628 --> 00:00:03.003
[Barney] Brilliant!

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:06.506
♪ Can't stop ♪

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.842
(knife clangs)
(laser squeals)

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.888
(mysterious music)

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:16.183
[Lee] Welcome home, honey.

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:18.977
[Gina] Do you read now?

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:19.770
- What is this?

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:20.687
- It's classified.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:23.398
- I'm comin' with you.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:25.067
- Oh, I'm sorry.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:27.194
You weren't invited.
- Oh.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.949
♪ Bad, bad, bad behavior ♪

00:00:31.949 --> 00:00:32.783
♪ Nothing can stop me ♪

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:34.034
♪ I can't get enough ♪

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.827
♪ Playing with danger
is bad behavior ♪

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:36.870
(knuckles crack)
- Oh.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.039
♪ Bad, bad, bad behavior ♪

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.040
(door crashes)

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:43.377
♪ They call it bad behavior ♪

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:45.170
(logo booms)

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.464
(Barney knocks)

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:48.840
- Hey. Why are you here?

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.551
[Barney] I got this situation
where I need your help.

00:00:52.344 --> 00:00:53.387
- I need better friends.

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:54.054
(logo crashes)

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.555
(mysterious music)

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:56.974
[Gunner] Is that the new guy?

00:00:56.974 --> 00:00:57.891
[Easy] This our sniper?

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.101
- Don't worry about it.

00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:00.560
I got a prescription scope.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.729
- Look Hawk Eyes,
remember this face.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:03.647
Don't shoot it by accident.

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:05.774
(both laugh)

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:06.858
[Marsh] Terrorists have
taken possession

00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:07.985
of nuclear missiles

00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:09.528
on a cargo ship off the coast.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.154
♪ Let's go, let's go ♪

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:12.239
If these babies go off,

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:13.156
(soldier inhales)

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:14.491
it'll be World War III.

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:16.660
Shhh.

00:01:17.411 --> 00:01:18.287
(guns click)
(lasers screech)

00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:19.997
- Take cover!

00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:21.581
(engine revs)

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.749
- You choose this life

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:25.335
over friends,
(fighter yells)

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:28.338
over family.
(motorcycle revs)

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:30.340
(bomb explodes)
- It's time to get loud.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:31.758
(soldier screams)

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.885
(upbeat music)
- Let's fly, baby!

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:34.177
(logo crashes)

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:37.097
♪ Can't stop. Addicted
to the shindig ♪

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:37.931
- Come on. Bring it!

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.391
♪ He says I'm gonna win big ♪

00:01:39.391 --> 00:01:41.643
♪ Choose not a life
of imitation ♪

00:01:41.643 --> 00:01:44.938
♪ Distant cousin to
the reservation ♪

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:45.856
(car explodes)

00:01:45.856 --> 00:01:47.107
- Now, that's what
I'm talkin' about.

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:49.943
♪ Can't stop, can't stop ♪

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:52.779
♪ Can't stop, can't stop ♪

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.949
(fighters grunting)

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.618
(knife scraping)

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.287
[Suarto] Is that the biggest
one you've got?

00:02:00.287 --> 00:02:01.288
(knife screeching)

00:02:01.288 --> 00:02:02.289
[Toll] Oh, it's way bigger
than that.

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:05.876
(upbeat rock music)

00:02:05.876 --> 00:02:06.626
(knife clangs)
(laser squeals)

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:07.753
(engine revs)

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:10.213
(logo crashes)

